{"id":"7c6f8c60d0c340bd","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-division-remainder-graphs.md","title":"含零除数约定的商余图","display":"df-division-remainder-graphs — 含零除数约定的商余图","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-division-remainder-graphs","aliases":["72-df-division-remainder-graphs"],"display":"df-division-remainder-graphs — 含零除数约定的商余图","depends_on":["[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]"],"chapter":"II","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.II §1.2.8(c),(d), print89/PDF101","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-division-remainder-graphs"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-division-remainder-graphs</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-division-remainder-graphs — 含零除数约定的商余图"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"II"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.II §1.2.8(c),(d), print89/PDF101"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,q,r\">\\(x,y,q,r\\)</span> 为互异数变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u&lt;v:=(u\\le v\\land u\\ne v)\">\\(u&lt;v:=(u\\le v\\land u\\ne v)\\)</span>，非零 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne0\">\\(y\\ne0\\)</span>。以下均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}\\)</span> 公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{DivGraph}(x,y,q)&amp;:=(y\\cdot q\\le x\\land x&lt;y\\cdot S q)\\lor(y=0\\land q=0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{QRGraph}(x,y,q,r)&amp;:=(y\\ne0\\land x=y\\cdot q+r\\land r&lt;y)\\lor(y=0\\land q=0\\land r=x).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{DivGraph}(x,y,q)&amp;:=(y\\cdot q\\le x\\land x&lt;y\\cdot S q)\\lor(y=0\\land q=0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{QRGraph}(x,y,q,r)&amp;:=(y\\ne0\\land x=y\\cdot q+r\\land r&lt;y)\\lor(y=0\\land q=0\\land r=x).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原书 x/0=0 的总化约定；相应余数 x mod 0=x，不能同时未经声明取成0。正除数采用通常欧几里得商余。所有乘法及比较都在基本语言中，尚未用除法项解释其自身图。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"x,y,q,r","display":false},{"tex":"u<v:=(u\\le v\\land u\\ne v)","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"y\\ne0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{DivGraph}(x,y,q)&:=(y\\cdot q\\le x\\land x<y\\cdot S q)\\lor(y=0\\land q=0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{QRGraph}(x,y,q,r)&:=(y\\ne0\\land x=y\\cdot q+r\\land r<y)\\lor(y=0\\land q=0\\land r=x).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1361,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"3df79cde2a855bea","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["5635e2f9f2823a2f"]}